  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Water Resources Management in Uzbekistan Ph 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the water sector reform through the development of an Integrated Water Resources Management (IWRM) - based strategic framework that ensures equitable and fair water distribution among all water users. This will allow the Ministry of Water Resources (MoWR) to efficiently and effectively manage water resources leading to increased water productivity and improved livelihoods of the rural population in Uzbekistan.</narrative>
  </description>
